      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Van_Buren%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A log courthouse was the first building erected in the new city site, standing west of the current courthouse.",
